      "Well then, what does “666” mean?",
      "In China, “666” is a very good word! Its meaning is ”liu liu liu”, where “liu” means “very good”.",
      "",
      "Then why do so many people like using the word “666”?",
      "It’s because writing Chinese characters when gaming is very troublesome, so gamers will write “666”.",
      "Gradually, many people have become fond of using “666”.",
